msgstr "Uppgiftsetapper"

#. module: project_task_payment
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:project_task_payment.field_account_payment__task_id
msgid "Task this payment compensates."
msgstr "Uppgift som betalningen ersätter."

#. module: project_task_payment
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:project_task_payment.field_project_task__show_payment_button
msgid ""
"Technical field: True when the task's stage has the 'Create Payment' flag "
"set. Not stored, so it always reflects the current stage configuration."
msgstr ""
"Tekniskt fält: Sant när uppgiftens etapp har flaggan 'Skapa betalning' satt. "
"Lagras inte, så det speglar alltid etappens aktuella konfiguration."

#. module: project_task_payment
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:project_task_payment.field_project_task_type__create_payment
msgid ""
"When a task reaches a stage with this flag set, the 'Create Payment' button "
"is shown on the task."
msgstr ""
"När en uppgift når en etapp med denna flagga satt visas knappen 'Skapa "
"betalning' på uppgiften."

#. module: project_task_payment
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/project_task_payment/models/project_task.py:0
msgid ""
"You do not have the rights to create payments. Please ask your administrator"
" to grant you the 'Invoicing' group."
msgstr ""
"Du har inte behörighet att skapa betalningar. Be din administratör att ge dig "
"gruppen 'Fakturering'."
